      "writtenOn": "2025-02-20T13:21:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The problem I have is the error message becomes a _lot_ more vague. Instead of pointing out that `++` is the issue, it just says the right hande side is wrong.\n\nThere is no valid parse of a `++` prefix operator at this point (even if you split the `+`, `+`), so I think it\u0027s safe to catch here and return a better error.",
      "parentUuid": "fc4f7ef0_bffbabf6",
      "revId": "6715a229397d32df1d1b3f24207e5929bf73d659",
