      "writtenOn": "2025-02-20T13:25:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For example if testing `+a` or even `^^b` (another invalid WGSL) instead of `++a` in this test, you will also get an unmatched but no error.\n\n```\n    auto p \u003d parser(\"^^b\");\n    auto e \u003d p-\u003eunary_expression();\n    EXPECT_FALSE(e.matched);\n    EXPECT_FALSE(e.errored);\n    EXPECT_EQ(e.value, nullptr);\n    EXPECT_FALSE(p-\u003ehas_error());\n```\n\nI can upload a CL to make `kPlusPlus` error here tomorrow. Would David please give some comment? Thanks!",
